    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a simple puzzle game about placing iceberg tiles on hexagonal sea tiles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on an iceberg to freely place it on the sea, but make sure to keep the icebergs apart from each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ Levels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 60+ handcrafted levels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of animals and mechanics make the puzzles engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable Animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet cute polar bears, penguins, walruses, and orcas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the same animals within one tile of each other, but avoid placing them near the orcas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game only requires clicking the left and right mouse buttons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's easy for anyone to pick up, from beginners of all ages to seasoned puzzle enthusiasts.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a simple puzzle game about placing iceberg tiles on hexagonal sea tiles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on an iceberg to freely place it on the sea, but make sure to keep the icebergs apart from each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ Levels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 60+ handcrafted levels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of animals and mechanics make the puzzles engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable Animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet cute polar bears, penguins, walruses, and orcas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the same animals within one tile of each other, but avoid placing them near the orcas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game only requires clicking the left and right mouse buttons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's easy for anyone to pick up, from beginners of all ages to seasoned puzzle enthusiasts.</p>",
